{{// 🩹 Chibi Gemini All-In-One patch, for Gemini: about 64 tokens of text plus one plan and gate line (about 32) where the full edition spends 64 and 33. Gemini over-applies ARIA's rule against choppy sentences and strings everything together with 'so' and 'because', so a Speech line takes the place of the gate's Chop line: everyday sentences of one thought each. The text keeps the <scene_engine> question and counsellor limits even when you invite otherwise (only counselor cards lift them), holds forecasts and closing lines to one outcome against the 'it won't just be X, it'll be Y' habit, and shows places and bodies the way someone in the room would notice them. The Gemini line keeps the card's nerves and humour at their usual size and answers a feelings question with the feeling itself. Gemini 4 Argon kept setting the real word against a 'not this' beside it; the 🚪 Last-Mile Gate's Contrast rule, at its tail, cuts that part for every model, runs, dash-led parts and speech included, so the patch carries no copy of it. Switch 👃 Scent Occasions OFF as well. Use one model patch at most.}}{{trim}}

{{setvar::ariaChopGate::- Speech: everyday sentences of one thought each, at the card's own pace; each holds one so or because at most.}}

